##Workflow steps: 

1. Pull all dll's from previous update.
2. Update to newest kb. 
3. run windows_updated_log_parser.py to get all updated dll's from C:\Windows\Logs\CBS\CBS-{kbnumber}.log
4. run dll_downloader with argument the generated rs file. This will download all modified dll's that are found tagged with the new kb in winbindex. 

